title: The Midnight theme: canvas, every panel, settings and a menu stay readable; back to Dark
folders: git-changes
allow-log: no theme named

wait 3000
theme midnight
wait 900
left files
wait 600
mark files
wait 500
left changes
wait 800
mark changes
wait 500
left search
wait 400
search step_1
wait 1000
mark search
wait 500
right symbols
select step_2
wait 800
mark symbols
wait 500
right deps
wait 600
mark deps
wait 500
left help
wait 600
mark help
wait 500
left extensions
wait 1200
mark extensions
wait 500
left settings:colours
wait 700
mark settings-colours
wait 500
left settings:appearance
wait 700
mark settings-appearance
wait 500
left settings:close
left files
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1200
menu 900 400
wait 600
mark card-and-menu
wait 500
theme no-such-theme
wait 400
theme dark
wait 900
mark dark-again
wait 500
quit
